      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for cadvisor fixes the following issues:\n\nChanges in cadvisor:\n\n* CVE-2026-78669: golang.org/x/net/http2: excessive CPU consumption from\n  repeated initial window changes (bsc#1285500)\n* CVE-2026-97032: golang.org/x/net/http2: HTTP/2 server crash due to\n  HPACK encoder race (bsc#1287575)\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
